      "ReviewText": "Ordered the Badger pole saw around the first of July to maintain trees.  Trees had been \"topped\" and trimmed Fall of 2025. As new branches began to emerge, I needed a tool to remove them. I've only used it once so far. It was fairly easy to assemble and operate. However, it was a little heavier than I expected. The included shoulder harness helps though. It would also be nice to include a starter bottle of oil with tool. I had to purchase a bottle of oil that will probably take some time to use based on my limited use of saw.",
